ClassroomIO — AWS Serverless Variant
=====================================

This project is an UNOFFICIAL derivative work based on ClassroomIO
(https://github.com/classroomio/classroomio), adapted to run on an AWS
serverless architecture (Amazon API Gateway + AWS Lambda, provisioned with
the AWS CDK).

It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the ClassroomIO
project or its maintainers.

