Summary of modifications in this variant
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Backend route groups reimplemented as individual AWS Lambda handlers
    behind an Amazon API Gateway HTTP API (see infrastructure/src/lambda/).
  - Infrastructure described as code using the AWS CDK
    (see infrastructure/lib/).
  - Transactional email delivery routed through Amazon SQS + Amazon SES.
  - Configuration generalized so the stack can be deployed to any AWS
    account via environment variables (no account-specific values committed).

The architecture migration was carried out primarily with Amazon Kiro
(https://kiro.dev), AWS's agentic IDE, using its spec-driven workflow.

All AWS account identifiers, domain names, and credentials have been removed
from this public distribution and replaced with generic placeholders.
